Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.57,0:01:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,,1997年8月29日 30亿人口被夺去了性命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three billion human lives ended on August 29th, 1997.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.34,0:01:26.71,Default,,0,0,0,,核大战之后的幸存者...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The survivors of the nuclear fire...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.75,0:01:29.51,Default,,0,0,0,,称这场战争为“审判日”{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}called the war "Judgment Day".{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.55,0:01:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,他们活下来只是为了面对新的梦魇...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They lived only to face a new nightmare...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.72,0:01:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,一场与机器间的战争{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the war against the machines.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.93,0:02:56.73,Default,,0,0,0,,控制着这些机器的电脑 天网...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The computer which controlled the machines, Skynet...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.77,0:02:59.80,Default,,0,0,0,,派遣两名终结者穿梭时空{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}sent two Terminators back through time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.84,0:03:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,它们的任务: 杀死人类反抗军领袖...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Their mission: to destroy the leader of the human resistance...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.98,0:03:06.61,Default,,0,0,0,,约翰康纳 我的儿子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}John Connor, my son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.65,0:03:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,第一位终结者被设定为毁灭我...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The first Terminator was programmed to strike at me...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.19,0:03:15.18,Default,,0,0,0,,时间是在1984年...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in the year 1984...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.22,0:03:17.59,Default,,0,0,0,,约翰出生之前{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}before John was born.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.63,0:03:19.49,Default,,0,0,0,,它失败了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It failed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.53,0:03:22.43,Default,,0,0,0,,第二名终结者则直接找到约翰本人...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The second was set to strike at John himself...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.47,0:03:24.96,Default,,0,0,0,,而当时 他还是个孩子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when he was still a child.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.17,0:03:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,依照惯例 反抗军会单独派遣一名战士...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As before, the resistance was able to send a lone warrior...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.44,0:03:34.77,Default,,0,0,0,,一个约翰的保护者{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a protector for John.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.81,0:03:38.25,Default,,0,0,0,,剩下的问题就是哪一个会先找到他？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was just a question of which one of them would reach him first.{\r}
