Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.97,0:07:56.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我要你的衣服 靴子以及摩托车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need your clothes, your boots and your motorcycle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.89,0:08:07.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你忘了说"请"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You forgot to say "please".{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.04,0:08:24.73,Default,,0,0,0,,快把他拖走!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get him off me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.23,0:08:49.79,Default,,0,0,0,,把刀拔出来!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pull it out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.02,0:09:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,给你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.05,0:09:39.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我不能让你抢走别人的摩托车 小子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can't let you take the man's wheels, son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.22,0:09:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,在我轰了你之前 下车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, get off before I put you down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.96,0:09:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,天杀的 别得寸进尺了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's it, goddamn it.{\r}
