Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.34,0:12:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,约翰进来把你的猪窝清理干净{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}John, get in there and clean up that pigsty of yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.92,0:12:57.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你的养父母都是混球 对吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your foster parents are kind of dicks, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.19,0:13:00.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我发誓 我真是受够了那该死的小鬼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I swear, I have had it with that goddamn kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.59,0:13:03.29,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他甚至连我的问话都不回答  - 甜心 别挡住{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He won't even answer me anymore.  - Honey, move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.33,0:13:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,可以高抬贵臀 帮我个忙吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would you get off your butt and help me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.33,0:13:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,- 托德!  - 干嘛?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Todd!  - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.23,0:13:12.63,Default,,0,0,0,,他的房间已经一个月没清理了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He hasn't cleaned that room of his in a month.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.67,0:13:15.83,Default,,0,0,0,,喔 要紧事是吧 等一下 我马上处理{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, it's an emergency. Hang on. I'll get right on it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.51,0:13:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,走吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.35,0:13:28.61,Default,,0,0,0,,给我滚进来 照你妈说的话去做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get your ass inside. Do what your mother tells you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.72,0:13:32.55,Default,,0,0,0,,她才不是我妈呢 托德{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's not my mother, Todd.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.05,0:13:41.65,Default,,0,0,0,,(皮斯卡德罗州立医院 加州){\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.05,0:14:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,接下来的这个病人很有趣{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This next patient is interesting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.78,0:14:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我观察这一案例已经好几年了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been following the case for years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.32,0:14:05.45,Default,,0,0,0,,现年29岁的女性...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A 29-year-old female...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.76,0:14:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,经诊断为严重的情感失调 所引起的精神分裂症患者{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}diagnosed as acute schizo-affective disorder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.50,0:14:13.79,Default,,0,0,0,,一般症状:沮丧 焦虑 暴力倾向...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The usual indicators: depression, anxiety, violent acting out...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.83,0:14:15.59,Default,,0,0,0,,有被害妄想症{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}delusions of persecution.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.97,0:14:25.41,Default,,0,0,0,,其妄想症的架构相当的独特{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The delusional architecture is fairly unique.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.44,0:14:28.31,Default,,0,0,0,,她认为一种叫终结者的机器人...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She believes that a machine called the Terminator...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.34,0:14:31.21,Default,,0,0,0,,外形犹如人类一般 穿越时空...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which looks human, of course, was sent back through time...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.81,0:14:33.87,Default,,0,0,0,,- 被派来杀死她  - 这故事真奇特{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- to kill her.  - That's original.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.91,0:14:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,同时 她孩子的父亲...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And also that the father of her child...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.22,0:14:40.55,Default,,0,0,0,,是一名被派遣来保护她的士兵{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}was a soldier sent back to protect her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.59,0:14:42.56,Default,,0,0,0,,他同样是来自于未来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was from the future too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.59,0:14:47.25,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我没记错的话 那是在2029年{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The year 2029, if I remember correctly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.29,0:14:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我们到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And here we are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.30,0:14:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,早安 莎拉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Morning, Sarah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.77,0:14:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,早安 西伯曼医生 膝盖还好吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good morning, Dr. Silberman. How's the knee?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.54,0:15:03.51,Default,,0,0,0,,好多了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fine, Sarah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.61,0:15:06.91,Default,,0,0,0,,几星期前 她拿了我的笔...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She stabbed me in the kneecap...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.95,0:15:10.51,Default,,0,0,0,,刺进我的膝盖骨{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with my pen a few weeks ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.55,0:15:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,多次试图逃跑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Repeated escape attempts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.23,0:15:24.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我们继续吧 好吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's move on, shall we?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.66,0:15:28.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我不喜欢看到 病人把房间弄得这么乱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't like to see the patients disrupting their rooms like this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.07,0:15:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,- 看着她把药吃了  - 好的 交给我吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- See she takes her Thorazine.  - Sure. I'll take care of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.18,0:15:47.31,Default,,0,0,0,,该吃药啦 康纳{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's time to take your meds, Connor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.35,0:15:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,留给你自己吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You take it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.16,0:15:50.65,Default,,0,0,0,,知道吗 你最好老实点...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now you know you gotta be good...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.69,0:15:52.56,Default,,0,0,0,,今天下午是回访观察日{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because you're up for review this afternoon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.59,0:15:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我不吃 我不想惹麻烦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not taking it, Dougie. I don't want any trouble.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.50,0:15:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,一点也不麻烦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ain't no trouble.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.91,0:16:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,对 给她上电击{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, zap her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.58,0:16:17.61,Default,,0,0,0,,最后关照 甜心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Last call, sugar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.59,0:16:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,做个好梦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sweet dreams.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.77,0:16:37.07,Default,,0,0,0,,(警车35679 "保护和服务"){\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.23,0:16:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你们是约翰康纳的法定监护人吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you the legal guardian of John Connor?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.69,0:17:00.96,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 警官 他又做什么了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's right, Officer. What's he done now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.99,0:17:03.99,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我可以跟他谈谈吗?  - 如果他在的话 当然可以{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Could I speak with him, please?  - You could if he were here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.03,0:17:06.93,Default,,0,0,0,,不过他今早骑摩托车出去了 现在可能在任何地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He took off on his bike this morning, so he could be anywhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.97,0:17:09.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你们有约翰的照片吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you have a photograph of John?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.37,0:17:10.63,Default,,0,0,0,,有 当然有 你等一下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, sure, hold on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.14,0:17:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,可以告诉我是什么事吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gonna tell me what this is about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.88,0:17:18.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我只需要问他几个问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just need to ask him a few questions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.11,0:17:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,看上去是个好漂亮的孩子 不介意我留下这张照片吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's a good-looking boy. Do you mind if I keep this picture?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.02,0:17:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,不 拿去吧 今早有个男人也找他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, go on. There was a guy here this morning looking for him too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.59,0:17:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,没错 一个骑摩托车的大个子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, a big guy on a bike.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.02,0:17:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,这两件事有关联吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Has that got something to do with this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.63,0:17:38.76,Default,,0,0,0,,不 甭担心那个人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I wouldn't worry about him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.80,0:17:41.67,Default,,0,0,0,,感谢你们的合作{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks for your cooperation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.84,0:17:45.67,Default,,0,0,0,,现在 请插入你偷来的卡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please insert your stolen card now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.91,0:17:53.98,Default,,0,0,0,,PIN码{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}PIN number.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.88,0:17:57.51,Default,,0,0,0,,快点 你弄得太久了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hurry up. This is taking too long.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.55,0:17:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,快 宝贝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go, baby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.62,0:18:02.11,Default,,0,0,0,,好呀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.16,0:18:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,- PIN码 9003  - 你从哪边学来的?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- PIN number 9003.  - Where'd you learn this stuff from?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.96,0:18:08.49,Default,,0,0,0,,从我妈那里 我是说我亲妈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From my mom. My real mom, I mean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.53,0:18:12.83,Default,,0,0,0,,领出300元{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Withdraw 300 bucks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.87,0:18:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,快点 宝贝 快来!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, baby. Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.74,0:18:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好极了!  - 嘿 成功了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yes!  - Hey, it worked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.07,0:18:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,好来 好容易得来的钱 走吧!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right. Easy money. Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.24,0:18:26.37,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊! 小菜一碟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes! Piece of cake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.62,0:18:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这就是她吗?  - 对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Is that her?  - Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.82,0:18:36.72,Default,,0,0,0,,她挺酷的 嗯?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's pretty cool, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.76,0:18:39.05,Default,,0,0,0,,才不呢 她是个十足的疯子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, she's a complete psycho.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.09,0:18:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,那就是为何她会在皮斯卡德罗 那可是一间精神病院 知道吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's why she's at Pescadero. It's a mental institute. OK?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.03,0:18:46.62,Default,,0,0,0,,她曾经想炸掉一座电脑工厂 但是中弹被逮捕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She tried to blow up a computer factory but got shot and arrested.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.67,0:18:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,不会吧 该死的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.47,0:18:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,她是个彻底的失败者{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's a total loser.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.94,0:18:54.67,Default,,0,0,0,,走吧 花钱去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. Let's go spend some money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.60,0:19:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,莎拉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sarah...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.44,0:19:25.37,Default,,0,0,0,,莎拉 醒醒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sarah, wake up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.45,0:19:34.17,Default,,0,0,0,,卡友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kyle{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.92,0:19:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,你已经死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.32,0:19:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的儿子在哪儿？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's our son, Sarah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.35,0:19:43.65,Default,,0,0,0,,他们把他从我身边抢走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They took him away from me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.69,0:19:46.92,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他现在是敌人的目标啊  - 我知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He's the target now.  - I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.96,0:19:49.09,Default,,0,0,0,,他孤身一人 你必须保护他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's all alone and you have to protect him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.13,0:19:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.63,0:19:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你告诉我 我到底该怎么做啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You tell me how I'm supposed to do that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.30,0:19:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,,他甚至不再相信我了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He doesn't even believe me anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.54,0:20:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我失去他了  - 你很坚强 莎拉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I've lost him.  - You're strong, Sarah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.64,0:20:03.13,Default,,0,0,0,,比你想像的还要坚强{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stronger than you ever thought you could be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.11,0:20:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,战士 站起来!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On your feet, soldier!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.65,0:20:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我爱你 莎拉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love you, Sarah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.15,0:20:11.45,Default,,0,0,0,,至死不渝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I always will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.75,0:20:13.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.95,0:20:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我会一直陪伴你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll always be with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.56,0:20:23.09,Default,,0,0,0,,还记得那段讯息吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember the message?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.13,0:20:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,未来尚未定数{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The future is not set.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.34,0:20:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,命运并不存在 要靠自己创造{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is no fate but what we make for ourselves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.69,0:20:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,和我在一起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.53,0:20:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,这世界马上要到最后的日子了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's not much time left in the world, Sarah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.70,0:21:04.73,Default,,0,0,0,,卡友 别走!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kyle, don't go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.88,0:21:18.91,Default,,0,0,0,,卡友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kyle!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.39,0:22:34.39,Default,,0,0,0,,它就像是一只巨大的闪光灯...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's like a giant strobe light...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.43,0:22:36.80,Default,,0,0,0,,向我的眼睛直烧而来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}burning right through my eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.77,0:22:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,不知为何 我仍然看得到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Somehow I can still see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.15,0:22:50.98,Default,,0,0,0,,天呀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.42,0:22:57.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我们都知道这梦境每晚一直重复着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We know the dream's the same every night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.95,0:23:01.35,Default,,0,0,0,,- 为什么还要我...  - 请继续{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Why do I have to...  - Please continue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.06,0:23:07.82,Default,,0,0,0,,孩子们像烧掉的纸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Children look like burnt paper.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.43,0:23:11.59,Default,,0,0,0,,焦黑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Black.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.63,0:23:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,动也不动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not moving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.40,0:23:17.84,Default,,0,0,0,,然后冲击波袭向他们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then the blast wave hits them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.12,0:23:29.85,Default,,0,0,0,,而他们就像叶子掉落般的飞散{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And they fly apart like leaves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.55,0:23:32.71,Default,,0,0,0,,梦见...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dreams...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.76,0:23:34.99,Default,,0,0,0,,战争 世界末日等的梦境...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of cataclysm, the end of the world...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.03,0:23:36.99,Default,,0,0,0,,都是比较常见的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}are very common.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.66,0:23:42.93,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是梦 你这白痴 这是真的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not a dream, you moron. It's real.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.97,0:23:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我知道它确实发生的日期  - 我相信你觉得那挺有真实感{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I know the date it happens.  - I'm sure it feels very real to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.00,0:23:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,,在1997年8月29日...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On August 29, 1997...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.57,0:23:53.13,Default,,0,0,0,,那天你也会感受到他妈的真实感!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's gonna feel pretty fuckin'real to you too!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.18,0:23:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,每个人都赤身露体 两百万倍的防晒指数 每个人都会大难临头 明白吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anybody not wearing two-million sunblock is gonna have a real bad day. Get it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.95,0:24:01.85,Default,,0,0,0,,老天啊 你认为你现在是安全的活着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}God, you think you're safe and alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.89,0:24:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,其实你已经死了 每个人都是!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're already dead. Everybody!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.25,0:24:06.82,Default,,0,0,0,,他或是你 你们早都死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Him. You. You're dead already.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.86,0:24:09.79,Default,,0,0,0,,这整个地方 你看见的 任何东西都已消失殆尽!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This whole place, everything you see is gone!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.83,0:24:13.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你才是个活在他妈梦里的人 因为我知道这件事发生了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're the one living in the fucking dream, 'cause I know it happened!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.96,0:24:15.93,Default,,0,0,0,,它发生了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It happened!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.91,0:24:29.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我现在觉得好多了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I feel much better now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.01,0:24:31.95,Default,,0,0,0,,思绪清楚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clearer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.98,0:24:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,没错 你的态度最近...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, your attitude has been...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.85,0:24:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,改善了不少{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}much improved lately.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.46,0:24:48.99,Default,,0,0,0,,有件事帮助我确定目标...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's helped me to have a goal...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.03,0:24:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,期待着它能实现{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}something to look forward to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.34,0:24:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,是什么呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.54,0:24:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 你说...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, you said...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.97,0:24:59.88,Default,,0,0,0,,如果6个月内我的情形有改善...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that if I showed improvement after six months...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.91,0:25:02.61,Default,,0,0,0,,你会把我转移到看守较松的监房...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you would transfer me to the minimum security wing...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.65,0:25:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,并且容许访客见我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I could have visitors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.05,0:25:09.61,Default,,0,0,0,,现在已经6个月了...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, it's been six months...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.65,0:25:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,还有...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.22,0:25:14.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我很期待可以见到我儿子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was looking forward to seeing my son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.56,0:25:17.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我懂了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.23,0:25:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,现在我们回到你所说的 那些终结者机器人上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go back to what you were saying about those Terminator machines.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.61,0:25:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,现在你不认为有这种东西了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now you think they don't exist?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.07,0:25:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,他们并不存在{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They don't exist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.51,0:25:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我现在明白了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know that now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.28,0:25:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,但是很多时候你告诉过我 关于...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you've told me on many occasions about how you crushed one...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.52,0:25:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你在液压机里压扁的那个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in a hydraulic press.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.99,0:25:43.15,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我曾做过这件事 现场应该会留下证据{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I had, there would have been some evidence.{\r}
