Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.68,0:42:35.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你要告诉那小鬼丢掉那只杂种狗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were gonna tell the kid to get rid of that fucking mutt.{\r}
