Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.86,0:42:50.89,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我在这 我很好  - 你确定没事吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm right here. I'm fine.  - Are you sure you're all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.94,0:42:54.27,Default,,0,0,0,,- 狗叫什么名字?  - 麦克斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's the dog's name?  - Max.{\r}
