Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.44,0:43:03.35,Default,,0,0,0,,沃菲没事  它好得很 {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wolfie's fine, honey. Wolfie's just fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.38,0:43:05.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你在哪里?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are you?{\r}
