Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.69,0:43:52.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你是说这东西可以模仿任何它摸过的物体?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're telling me that this thing can imitate anything it touches?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.10,0:43:55.07,Default,,0,0,0,,任何它以身体接触采样的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anything it samples by physical contact.{\r}
