Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.48,0:44:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,为何不直接变成炸弹来干掉我?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why not just become a bomb or something to get me?{\r}
