Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.81,0:45:14.35,Default,,0,0,0,,康纳小姐 我们晓得 你知道这人是谁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Miss Connor, we know you know who this guy is.{\r}
