Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.28,0:45:26.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我们知道这家伙牵涉其中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We know this guy's involved.{\r}
