Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.28,0:45:51.55,Default,,0,0,0,,如果她完全清醒 而且能提供 任何消息 我会通知你们的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If she clears at all and can give us anything, I'll call you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.58,0:45:53.18,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure.{\r}
