Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.81,0:46:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,这样她就能教我如何成为 一个伟大的军事领袖{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so she could teach me how to be this great military leader.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.82,0:46:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,然后她被逮捕了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then she gets busted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.92,0:46:29.55,Default,,0,0,0,,好像是说 "抱歉 小子 你妈是疯子 你不知道吗?"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's like, "Sorry, kid, your mom's a psycho. Didn't you know?"{\r}
