Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.79,0:47:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,,它将模仿莎拉康纳的形象 并等你去找她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}will be to copy Sarah Connor and wait for you to make contact with her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.93,0:47:08.05,Default,,0,0,0,,好极了 那她会怎样?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Great. What happens to her?{\r}
