Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.07,0:47:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,糟糕! 你为什么不早说? 我们现在得马上赶过去!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit! Why didn't you tell me? We gotta go right now!{\r}
