Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.54,0:47:18.73,Default,,0,0,0,,去你的! 救她是我的优先任务!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fuck you! She's a priority to me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.57,0:47:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,该死! 你是哪里不对劲了? 该死! 救命!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goddamn it! What's your problem? Damn it! Help!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.65,0:47:26.51,Default,,0,0,0,,这对我们的任务没有帮助{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This does not help our mission.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.55,0:47:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,把这疯子拉开! 救命!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get this psycho off of me! Help!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.08,0:47:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我被绑架了! 把这疯子拉走!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm being kidnapped! Get this psycho off of me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.22,0:47:33.28,Default,,0,0,0,,放开我!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.79,0:47:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你干嘛这样?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why the hell did you do that?{\r}
