Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.34,1:03:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,马上!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.97,1:04:07.99,Default,,0,0,0,,开车!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.25,1:04:20.48,Default,,0,0,0,,子弹用完了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.29,1:04:29.19,Default,,0,0,0,,- 快点  - 拿去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on.  - Here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.73,1:04:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,重新填弹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Reload.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.74,1:04:44.73,Default,,0,0,0,,最后一个弹匣了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Last one!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.92,1:04:53.51,Default,,0,0,0,,坐稳了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hang on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.71,1:05:21.27,Default,,0,0,0,,装好了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ready!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.96,1:05:36.89,Default,,0,0,0,,来开车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here, drive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.12,1:06:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,后面没人 他没追上来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's not back there. There's nobody behind us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.42,1:06:34.39,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你没事吧?  - 对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Are you all right?  - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.06,1:06:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你看得见路吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you see anything?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.39,1:06:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我看的一清二楚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.03,1:06:42.86,Default,,0,0,0,,(强化视讯模式){\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.50,1:06:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,酷{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.73,1:06:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,过来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.41,1:06:58.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我说过我没事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I said I was okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.01,1:07:02.11,Default,,0,0,0,,约翰 你跑到那里很愚蠢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}John, it was stupid of you to go there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.08,1:07:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,你必需更聪明点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}God. damn it. You have to be smarter than that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.42,1:07:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你差点就被杀了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were almost killed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.25,1:07:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你在想些什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What were you thinking?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.89,1:07:13.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你不能以身犯险 即使是为了我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You cannot risk yourself, even for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.59,1:07:15.15,Default,,0,0,0,,懂了吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you understand?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.20,1:07:16.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你太重要了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're too important.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.80,1:07:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,知道吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you understand?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.34,1:07:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,但是...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.14,1:07:28.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我必须把你救出来 我很抱歉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had to get you out of that place. I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.51,1:07:32.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我不需要你的帮忙 我可以照顾自己{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't need your help. I can take care myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.72,1:07:41.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你的眼睛怎么啦?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's wrong with your eyes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.29,1:07:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,没什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.63,1:07:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,那么 你又是什么来头?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, what's your story?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.64,1:08:08.77,Default,,0,0,0,,你没事吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.81,1:08:10.28,Default,,0,0,0,,没事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:12.08,1:08:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,说起来 这辆摩托车真不错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Say, that's a nice bike.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.88,1:08:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,小点劲 大老粗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch it, lug nuts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.12,1:08:50.55,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 你知道该怎么缝合吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, do you know what you're doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.59,1:08:53.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我有人体解剖学的详细资料{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have detailed files on human anatomy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:54.33,1:08:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,,不赖啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I bet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:56.36,1:08:59.39,Default,,0,0,0,,这让你变成更有效率的杀手 对吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Makes you a more efficient killer, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.43,1:09:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,完全正确{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Correct.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.64,1:09:08.61,Default,,0,0,0,,你中弹时会觉得痛吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Does it hurt when you get shot?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.67,1:09:13.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我感应得到伤害 可以称做'疼痛'{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I sense injuries. The data could be called "pain."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.48,1:09:17.45,Default,,0,0,0,,约翰 帮我照亮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}John, help me with the light.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.48,1:09:19.81,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这些伤口会愈合吗?  - 会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Will these heal up?  - Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.85,1:09:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,很好 如果你看起来不像人类 对我们就没多大用处了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good. If you can't pass for human, you're not much good to us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.12,1:09:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你能活多久? 我是指 可以用多久{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How long do you live? I mean, last. Whatever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.29,1:09:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,内藏电池可持续使用120年{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A hundred and twenty years with my existing power cell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.30,1:09:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你能学些程序未预设的东西吗...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you learn stuff that you haven't been programmed with...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.30,1:09:34.77,Default,,0,0,0,,然后你就可以...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so you can be...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.97,1:09:38.73,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道 更像人...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you know, more human...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.77,1:09:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,,而不会总像个呆子?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and not such a dork all the time?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.68,1:09:48.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我的中央处理器 具备神经网络 处理程序 是有学习能力的电脑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My CPU is a neural net processor, a learning computer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.28,1:09:52.65,Default,,0,0,0,,但当我们被派遣出来时 天网将其预设为只读{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But Skynet presets the switch to read-only when we're sent out alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.99,1:09:56.45,Default,,0,0,0,,不让你想太多 对吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doesn't want you to do too much thinking, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.49,1:09:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,,对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.39,1:10:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我们能重置这设定吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can we reset the switch?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.68,1:10:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,,逆时针旋转两个锁住的圆柱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rotate the two locking cylinders counterclockwise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.02,1:10:31.55,Default,,0,0,0,,执行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.70,1:10:42.19,Default,,0,0,0,,然后打开连接护盖{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now open the port cover.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.70,1:10:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,向外拉 开启它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pull to break the seal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.38,1:10:54.40,Default,,0,0,0,,很好 现在移除震动阻尼配件{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good, now remove the shock-damping assembly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.92,1:11:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,现在你就可以拿到中央处理器了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can now access the CPU.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.36,1:11:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,- 看到了吗?  - 看到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Do you see it?  - Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.62,1:11:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,抓住中央处理器的基板{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold the CPU by its base tab.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.63,1:11:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,拉出来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pull.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.43,1:11:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你看到开关了吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you see the pin switch?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.24,1:11:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,不行! 不行!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.11,1:11:53.77,Default,,0,0,0,,- 别拦着我 John  - 别杀了他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Out of my way, John.  - Don't kill him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.81,1:11:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,是它 约翰 不是他 是它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It, John, not him. It.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.18,1:12:00.71,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧"它" 但是我们需要"它"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, "It". But we need "It".{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.75,1:12:03.41,Default,,0,0,0,,仔细听我说 你听好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen to me. You listen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.45,1:12:05.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我们最好靠自己{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're better-off on our own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.66,1:12:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,但他是我们仅有的证据...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But he's the only proof we have...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.56,1:12:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,有关未来以及那场战役等等{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of the future and the war and all that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.13,1:12:11.56,Default,,0,0,0,,也许吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.13,1:12:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我不相信它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't trust it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.26,1:12:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,可他是我的朋友 好吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But he's my friend, all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.80,1:12:21.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你不了解 要消灭 这样一个东西有多难...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't know what it's like to try to kill one of these things...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.67,1:12:25.27,Default,,0,0,0,,如果会出什么意外 现在就是我们 唯一的机会 所以赶快让开!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and if something goes wrong this could be our last chance, so move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:25.31,1:12:27.43,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 妈妈 如果我将来真会成为那个伟大军事领袖...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look mom, if I'm ever supposed to be this great military leader...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:27.48,1:12:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,那也许你应该开始听听我的领导意见了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}maybe you should start listening to my leadership ideas once in a while.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.32,1:12:36.11,Default,,0,0,0,,因为如果连我的母亲都不肯听...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because if my own mother won't...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.15,1:12:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你还能期望别的什么人会听吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}how do you expect anyone else to?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.17,1:12:56.26,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 就依你说的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, play it your way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.73,1:13:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,(系统中断){\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.80,1:13:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,(诊断中){\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.68,1:13:05.77,Default,,0,0,0,,有什么问题吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Was there a problem?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.82,1:13:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No problem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:09.02,1:13:10.28,Default,,0,0,0,,一点问题也没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}None whatsoever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:43.91,1:13:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,学到点东西了吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are we learning yet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.30,1:14:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我们必须离城市越远越好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have to get as far away from the city as possible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.97,1:14:06.59,Default,,0,0,0,,直向南行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just head south.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.34,1:14:16.97,Default,,0,0,0,,时速别超过65里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep it under 65.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:17.01,1:14:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们可不想被交警抓住  - 收到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We don't want to be pulled over.  - Affirmative.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.22,1:14:25.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你必须听听人们怎么说话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gotta listen to the way people talk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.79,1:14:29.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你不能说"收到"或之类的废话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't say "affirmative" or some shit like that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:29.39,1:14:31.69,Default,,0,0,0,,你要说"没有问题"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You say, "No problemo".{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.73,1:14:35.69,Default,,0,0,0,,如果某人用很不屑的态度 向你走来 你得说"吃屎吧"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If someone comes off to you with an attitude, you say, "Eat me."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:35.73,1:14:40.03,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你想向人炫耀 就说 "后会有期 宝贝"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And if you want to shine them on, it's "Hasta la vista, baby."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.60,1:14:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,后会有期 宝贝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hasta la vista, baby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:43.34,1:14:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,对 或者是"再会了 麻瓜"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, or "Later, dick-wad".{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.44,1:14:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,某人心烦意乱时 就说"冷静点"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If someone gets upset, you say, "Chill out".{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:48.55,1:14:50.01,Default,,0,0,0,,或者你也可以凑起来说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or you can do combinations.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:50.71,1:14:53.05,Default,,0,0,0,,冷静点 麻瓜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chill out, dick-wad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.85,1:14:55.87,Default,,0,0,0,,这就对了 看吧? 你开始懂了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's great. See? You're getting it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:55.99,1:14:57.01,Default,,0,0,0,,没有问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No problemo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.03,1:15:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你身上有现金吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got any cash?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.03,1:15:13.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我这儿有好几百块 可以给你一半{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got a couple hundred bucks. I'll give you half.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.67,1:15:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,妈!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mom!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.50,1:15:18.53,Default,,0,0,0,,买点吃的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get some food.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:20.51,1:15:23.03,Default,,0,0,0,,真没幽默感{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No sense of humor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.18,1:15:31.95,Default,,0,0,0,,还有一件事 你要让自己稍稍阳光一点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's another thing. You can lighten up a bit yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.85,1:15:35.05,Default,,0,0,0,,一本正经 例行公事 实在很无聊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This severe routine is getting old, okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.09,1:15:36.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我是说 你表现得就像个怪物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, you're acting like such a geek.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:37.03,1:15:39.05,Default,,0,0,0,,时不时微笑一下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Smile once in a while.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.09,1:15:40.49,Default,,0,0,0,,微笑?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Smile?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.53,1:15:44.49,Default,,0,0,0,,对啊 微笑 看着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, you know, smile. Watch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.47,1:15:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨 不错的地方 生意如何?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi. Nice place you got here. How's business?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.10,1:15:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,别碍着我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me a break.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.87,1:15:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 错误的示范{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, bad example.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:56.01,1:15:57.71,Default,,0,0,0,,看到那边那个家伙了吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See that guy over there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.74,1:15:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,那就是微笑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's a smile.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.47,1:16:03.26,Default,,0,0,0,,(动态选择){\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:03.26,1:16:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,(分析中){\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:19.00,1:16:20.49,Default,,0,0,0,,很不错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:20.54,1:16:24.37,Default,,0,0,0,,也许 你该在镜子前再练练什么的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe you could practice in front of a mirror or something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.75,1:16:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,要不要吃点薯条?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Want some of my fries?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.69,1:16:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,需要帮忙吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Need any help?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:44.69,1:16:46.39,Default,,0,0,0,,不用{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:46.43,1:16:48.29,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我抓到你了!  - 不 才没有!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I got you!  - No, you didn't!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:56.64,1:16:59.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我们办不到的 对吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're not gonna make it, are we?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:01.68,1:17:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我是指 人们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}People, I mean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:05.72,1:17:07.95,Default,,0,0,0,,以邻为壑是人类的天性{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's in your nature to destroy yourselves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:08.99,1:17:11.96,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 接受这样的教育 哈?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Major drag, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:13.09,1:17:14.49,Default,,0,0,0,,在我扭断你们的脖子前别玩了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Break it up before I wring both of your necks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:17.02,1:17:20.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我得知道天网是如何建造的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need to know how Skynet gets built.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.19,1:17:21.49,Default,,0,0,0,,谁是负责人?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who's responsible?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.53,1:17:25.13,Default,,0,0,0,,主要负责人是迈尔斯·本尼特·戴森{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The man most directly responsible is Miles Bennett Dyson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:25.67,1:17:26.93,Default,,0,0,0,,他是谁?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.97,1:17:30.93,Default,,0,0,0,,他是赛博坦系统公司的特别计划主管{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's the director of special projects at Cyberdyne Systems Corporation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.68,1:17:35.47,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么是他?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.51,1:17:38.91,Default,,0,0,0,,几个月后 他创造了 一款革命性的微处理器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In a few months he creates a revolutionary type of microprocessor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:39.95,1:17:41.31,Default,,0,0,0,,继续说 然后呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go on. Then what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:42.38,1:17:45.35,Default,,0,0,0,,三年内 赛博坦将会变成...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In three years, Cyberdyne will become the largest supplier...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:45.39,1:17:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,军事电脑系统的最大供应商{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of military computer systems.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:47.86,1:17:50.83,Default,,0,0,0,,所有隐形轰炸机采用赛博坦电脑...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All Stealth bombers are upgraded with Cyberdyne computers...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:50.86,1:17:52.35,Default,,0,0,0,,渐渐变成无人驾驶的战斗机{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}becoming fully unmanned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.39,1:17:55.49,Default,,0,0,0,,然后以完美的操作记录飞行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Afterwards they fly with a perfect operational record.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:55.53,1:17:58.23,Default,,0,0,0,,建造天网的基金法案通过了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Skynet funding bill is passed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:58.27,1:18:01.57,Default,,0,0,0,,在1997年8月4日 系统正式启用{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The system goes on-line on August 4, 1997.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.60,1:18:04.83,Default,,0,0,0,,由于战略防御措施 人类斗志消散{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Human decisions are removed from strategic defense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:04.87,1:18:07.64,Default,,0,0,0,,天网以几何倍数的速率开始学习{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Skynet begins to learn at a geometric rate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:07.68,1:18:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,在东部时间 8月29日早上2:14 它变得具有自我意识{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It becomes self-aware at 2:14 a.m. Eastern time, August 29.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.05,1:18:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,在一阵恐慌中 他们想把电源拔掉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In a panic, they try to pull the plug.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:16.78,1:18:19.05,Default,,0,0,0,,- 天网便开始反击  - 对的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Skynet fights back.  - Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:19.09,1:18:21.89,Default,,0,0,0,,它向俄国境内的目标发射了核弹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It launches its missiles against the targets in Russia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:21.92,1:18:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么攻击俄国人? 他们不是盟国吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why attack Russia? Aren't they our friends now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.06,1:18:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,因为天网知道俄国人的反击...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because Skynet knows that the Russian counterattack...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.53,1:18:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,可以消灭它在当地的所有敌人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}will eliminate its enemies over here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:29.53,1:18:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,老天{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:33.80,1:18:36.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你对戴森了解多少?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How much do you know about Dyson?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:37.87,1:18:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我有详细的资料{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have detailed files.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.01,1:18:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我要知道所有的事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want to know everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:44.21,1:18:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,他长相如何 他住哪里 一切资料{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What he looks like, where he lives, everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:59.89,1:19:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,迈尔斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Miles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:03.70,1:19:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,迈尔斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Miles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:23.58,1:19:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,你打算要工作一整天吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gonna to work all day?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:25.42,1:19:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我很抱歉 宝贝 但这东西一直在烦我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry, baby. But this thing is just kicking my ass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:29.36,1:19:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,迈尔斯 今天是星期日{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Miles, it's Sunday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.76,1:19:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你答应今天带孩子们去水上乐园玩的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You promised to take the kids to Raging Waters today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.09,1:19:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我没办法...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.26,1:19:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我就差临门一脚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm on a roll.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:51.78,1:19:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,宝贝 我一走的话将功亏一篑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Baby, this is going to blow them all away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:54.11,1:19:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,- 它是一个神经网络处理器  - 我知道 你告诉过我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's a neural net processor.  - I know. You told me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.28,1:20:00.48,Default,,0,0,0,,它可以像人类一般思考及学习{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a neural net processor. It thinks and learns like we do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.52,1:20:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,它在室温条件下就具备超级处理性能{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's superconducting at room temperature.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:03.29,1:20:07.56,Default,,0,0,0,,其他的电脑 相形之下 只能算是口袋型计算器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Other computers are just pocket calculators by comparison.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:09.46,1:20:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,但为什么这该死的东西那么重要？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But why is that so goddamn important, Miles?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.80,1:20:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我真的想知道...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I really need to know...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:13.20,1:20:16.33,Default,,0,0,0,,因为有时 我觉得自己都快抓狂了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because sometimes I feel like I'm going crazy here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:17.97,1:20:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,宝贝 我就快接近完成了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Baby, I am this close.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:21.08,1:20:22.10,Default,,0,0,0,,过来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:24.71,1:20:27.27,Default,,0,0,0,,想像一台大型喷气式客机...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Imagine a jet airliner...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:27.31,1:20:30.01,Default,,0,0,0,,由一名永不疲倦 永不犯错的飞行员驾驶...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with a pilot that never gets tired, never makes mistakes...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:30.05,1:20:31.95,Default,,0,0,0,,更别说会睡眼惺忪的去上班{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}never shows up to work with a hangover.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.32,1:20:36.79,Default,,0,0,0,,就是这位飞行员{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Meet the pilot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:36.82,1:20:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么我们要结婚？为什么我们还要生小孩？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why did we get married, Miles? Why did we have these children?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:40.00,1:20:41.05,Default,,0,0,0,,你根本不需要我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't need us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:41.10,1:20:44.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你的心思及精神都放在这上面了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your heart and your mind are in here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:44.63,1:20:47.53,Default,,0,0,0,,但是它不会像我们一样的爱你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it doesn't love you like we do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:55.68,1:20:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我很抱歉 真的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry. Really.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:58.35,1:21:02.65,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么不多花上一点时间 陪陪你的另一些宝贝?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How about spending some time with your other babies?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:05.29,1:21:07.15,Default,,0,0,0,,雷霆水上乐园!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Raging Waters!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:36.82,1:21:38.88,Default,,0,0,0,,在车里等着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait in the car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:57.36,1:22:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,恩利科？你在吗？{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:16.96,1:22:18.69,Default,,0,0,0,,你很神经质啊 康纳{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're pretty jumpy, Connor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:20.69,1:22:21.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你也是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You too.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:24.84,1:22:27.03,Default,,0,0,0,,过得怎么样？{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:27.04,1:22:33.03,Default,,0,0,0,,- 很高兴见到你，康纳   - 我答应过会再回来的{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:33.04,1:22:35.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我可老是在这里埋伏着{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:35.04,1:22:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,尤兰达，快出来，有客人来了，顺便再拿些龙舌兰酒出来！{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:39.58,1:22:41.21,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 约翰{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, big John.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:41.95,1:22:43.01,Default,,0,0,0,,过得怎么样?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:44.22,1:22:45.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你的朋友是谁？{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:45.39,1:22:46.71,Default,,0,0,0,,他没问题 他跟我们一起的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's cool, Enrique. He's with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:46.76,1:22:49.95,Default,,0,0,0,,他是...鲍伯叔叔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's...Uncle Bob.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:49.99,1:22:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,,鲍伯叔叔 这位是恩利科{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uncle Bob, this is Enrique.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:52.16,1:22:54.09,Default,,0,0,0,,鲍伯叔叔 嗯?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uncle Bob, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.13,1:22:56.43,Default,,0,0,0,,好啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:58.72,1:23:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好久不见   - 好久不见{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:01.92,1:23:03.35,Default,,0,0,0,,都长这么高啦…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.91,1:23:04.93,Default,,0,0,0,,喝酒吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Drink?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:10.15,1:23:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,“鲍伯叔叔”?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Uncle Bob"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:13.58,1:23:16.55,Default,,0,0,0,,这下你出名了 电视上各频道都在播{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're pretty famous, all over the goddamn TV.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:16.59,1:23:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,你 约翰 还有你大朋友的照片{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pictures of you, John, your big friend here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:19.32,1:23:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,警察像发疯似的到处找你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cops are going nuts looking for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:25.09,1:23:29.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我是来拿家伙的 我需要 衣服 食物以及一辆卡车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just came for my stuff. I need clothes, food and a truck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:29.26,1:23:31.23,Default,,0,0,0,,要不要还要我牙缝里的东西?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How about the fillings in my teeth?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:31.27,1:23:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,现在就要{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, Enrique.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:34.77,1:23:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你们两个负责去检查武器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You two, you're on weapons detail.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:37.04,1:23:38.37,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧 我们走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:59.33,1:24:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,关于我妈有件事...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One thing about my mom...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:03.57,1:24:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,她老是预先计划{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}she always plans ahead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:16.41,1:24:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,好极了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excellent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:28.05,1:24:31.75,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我最好的卡车了 但是发动装置不见了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the best truck I got, but the starter motor's gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:31.79,1:24:33.76,Default,,0,0,0,,有空等我换好它吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got time to change it out?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:33.79,1:24:37.19,Default,,0,0,0,,当然 我要等天黑后再穿越边界{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. I'm gonna wait 'til dark to cross the border.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:37.23,1:24:38.75,Default,,0,0,0,,恩利科{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Enrique.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:38.80,1:24:42.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你们留在这里很危险 今晚也离开 好吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's dangerous for you here. You get out tonight too, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:42.43,1:24:45.03,Default,,0,0,0,,好的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:45.07,1:24:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,随便找上个时间来拜访 然后彻底搞乱我的生活 对吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just drop by anytime and totally fuck up my life, all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:53.21,1:24:56.77,Default,,0,0,0,,你瞧 我在这样的地方长大...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See, I grew up in places like this...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:56.82,1:24:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我就认为 这就是人们 如何过活的方式...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so I just thought that's how people lived...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:00.55,1:25:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,搭着直升机四处乱飞...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}riding around in helicopters...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:04.36,1:25:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,学习如何扔狗屎炸弹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}learning how to blow shit up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:07.59,1:25:10.29,Default,,0,0,0,,但是当我妈被逮捕后...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But then when my mom got busted...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:10.33,1:25:12.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我被送进了正规学校{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got put into a regular school.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:13.37,1:25:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,其他的小孩都在玩任天堂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All the other kids were into Nintendo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:30.88,1:25:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你曾感到害怕吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you ever afraid?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:33.12,1:25:35.31,Default,,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:38.29,1:25:39.99,Default,,0,0,0,,即使快死了也不会?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not even of dying?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:40.63,1:25:42.49,Default,,0,0,0,,不会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:46.90,1:25:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你对这档子事没有任何感觉 还是对别的什么事有感觉?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't feel any emotion about it, one way or another?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:51.24,1:25:55.23,Default,,0,0,0,,没有 我必须保持机能 正常运作 直至任务完成{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. I have to stay functional until my mission is complete.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:00.21,1:26:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,这之后 就无关紧要了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then it doesn't matter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:03.42,1:26:07.05,Default,,0,0,0,,对啊 我也得保持机能正常 运作 因为我"太重要了"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have to stay functional too. "I'm too important."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:23.40,1:26:25.17,Default,,0,0,0,,看起来真配你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's definitely you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:36.48,1:26:38.95,Default,,0,0,0,,大部份跟我妈在一起的人都是怪胎...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Most of the guys my mom hung around with were geeks...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:39.55,1:26:43.11,Default,,0,0,0,,但是有一个家伙 他挺酷的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but there was this one guy, he was kinda cool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:43.15,1:26:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,他教我引擎的原理{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He taught me engines.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:45.16,1:26:47.39,Default,,0,0,0,,抓住这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:47.43,1:26:49.86,Default,,0,0,0,,当然啦 妈又搞砸了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mom screwed it up, of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:49.89,1:26:52.38,Default,,0,0,0,,她常常告诉他们关于审判日的事...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She'd always tell 'em about Judgment Day...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:52.43,1:26:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,而我会是这世界的领袖{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and me being this world leader.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:55.30,1:26:57.27,Default,,0,0,0,,她总是这么说着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That'd be all she wrote.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:58.60,1:26:59.73,Default,,0,0,0,,请递转矩板手给我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Torque wrench, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:01.97,1:27:03.23,Default,,0,0,0,,拿去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:03.27,1:27:06.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我希望我能遇见真正的父亲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wish I could've met my real dad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:06.54,1:27:08.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你会的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:08.38,1:27:10.61,Default,,0,0,0,,对呀 我猜也是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I guess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:10.65,1:27:14.52,Default,,0,0,0,,当我大概45岁时吧 我想{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I'm, like, 45, I think.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:14.55,1:27:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我把他送至1984年{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They sent him back through time to 1984.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:18.36,1:27:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,好家伙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:21.33,1:27:23.79,Default,,0,0,0,,他那时甚至还未出生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He hasn't even been born yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:25.56,1:27:27.53,Default,,0,0,0,,这会让你头脑混乱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It messes with your head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:30.24,1:27:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,- 另一个螺栓  - 喔 给{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- The other bolt.  - Oh. Here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:39.51,1:27:43.11,Default,,0,0,0,,妈跟他在一起才一个晚上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mom and him were only together for one night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:43.15,1:27:45.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我猜她还爱着他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She still loves him, I guess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:45.68,1:27:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我有时看到她在哭{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see her crying sometimes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:48.65,1:27:53.11,Default,,0,0,0,,她当然完全不承认 就说有东西飞进她的眼睛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She denies it totally, of course, like she got something stuck in her eye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:57.60,1:27:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你们为什么会哭?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why do you cry?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:00.23,1:28:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你是指人们为什么会哭?  - 对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You mean people?  - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:01.80,1:28:03.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:03.27,1:28:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我们就是会哭...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We just cry...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:05.44,1:28:08.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道 当有伤痛时{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you know, when it hurts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:14.08,1:28:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,痛苦造成的吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pain causes it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:16.92,1:28:19.08,Default,,0,0,0,,不 那是两码事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. It's different.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:19.12,1:28:22.45,Default,,0,0,0,,当你没有任何不对劲 但你就是觉得内心悲痛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's when there's nothing wrong with you, but you hurt anyway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:22.49,1:28:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你懂吗?  - 不懂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You get it?  - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:25.36,1:28:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,好极了 我的伙计!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, my man!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:27.69,1:28:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,没有问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No problemo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:28.90,1:28:30.52,Default,,0,0,0,,给我五{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me five.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:32.57,1:28:34.69,Default,,0,0,0,,就把你的手放成这样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just put out your hand like this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:36.04,1:28:40.37,Default,,0,0,0,,对了! 现在打回来 击掌 照着做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right! Now hit me. Give me five. Do the same thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:45.08,1:28:47.57,Default,,0,0,0,,好 这就对了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, that's good. Up high.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:48.51,1:28:49.85,Default,,0,0,0,,低手击掌{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Five low.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:50.58,1:28:51.61,Default,,0,0,0,,太慢了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Too slow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:54.56,1:28:56.85,Default,,0,0,0,,只是开个玩笑 再来一次{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm just kidding. One more time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:56.89,1:28:59.15,Default,,0,0,0,,很好 现在试试这个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good. Now try it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:59.19,1:29:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,现在换我 给我个五{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now do me. Give me five.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:02.60,1:29:07.19,Default,,0,0,0,,看着约翰跟那机器在一起 思绪忽然清晰起来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watching John with the machine, it was suddenly so clear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:07.23,1:29:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,终结者永远不会停止运行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Terminator would never stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:10.24,1:29:14.23,Default,,0,0,0,,不会离开他 也永远不会伤害他...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It would never leave him, an he would never hurt him...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:14.28,1:29:17.73,Default,,0,0,0,,不会对他大吼大叫 酒醉揍他...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}never shout at him or get drunk and hit him...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:17.78,1:29:20.37,Default,,0,0,0,,或者是太忙而没空陪他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or be too busy to spend time with him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:21.21,1:29:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,它会永远在他身边...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}lt would always be there...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:23.42,1:29:26.11,Default,,0,0,0,,至死都会保护他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and it would die to protect him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:27.49,1:29:30.89,Default,,0,0,0,,纵观所有来去数年 将成为John继父的人...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of all the would-be fathers who came and went over the years...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:30.93,1:29:32.99,Default,,0,0,0,,这东西 这个机器...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}this thing, this machine...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:33.03,1:29:35.43,Default,,0,0,0,,是唯一符合标准的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}was the only one who measured up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:36.16,1:29:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,在这个疯狂的世界里...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In an insane world...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:38.10,1:29:40.07,Default,,0,0,0,,这是一个疯狂的抉择{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it was the sanest choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:17.84,1:31:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我们来玩玩这个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, let's try this one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:25.41,1:31:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,坐上来啰{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There we go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:50.94,1:32:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,(命运不存在){\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:13.69,1:33:16.21,Default,,0,0,0,,她关照说你跟他向南行 按计划{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She said go south with him like you planned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:16.26,1:33:18.49,Default,,0,0,0,,- 她明天会跟你们会合  - 妈!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- She'll meet you tomorrow.  - Mom!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:20.26,1:33:21.45,Default,,0,0,0,,妈 等一下!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mom, wait!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:36.71,1:33:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,“命运不存在”{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"No fate."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:39.38,1:33:41.85,Default,,0,0,0,,命运是由自己创造的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No fate but what we make.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:43.95,1:33:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我父亲告诉她的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My father told her this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:48.52,1:33:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我是说 在未来我嘱咐他 要记下并转达给她的讯息{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean I made him memorize it in the future as a message to her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:54.46,1:33:56.43,Default,,0,0,0,,算了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:56.46,1:33:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 整件事是...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, the whole thing goes...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:59.40,1:34:02.13,Default,,0,0,0,,未来尚未定数{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The future's not set.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:02.17,1:34:05.73,Default,,0,0,0,,命运并不存在 要靠自己创造{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's no fate but what we make for ourselves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:05.97,1:34:09.03,Default,,0,0,0,,她打算要改变未来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She intends to change the future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:09.08,1:34:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,对 我猜是这样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I guess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:12.08,1:34:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 糟了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:13.98,1:34:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,,- 戴森  - 对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Dyson.  - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:15.98,1:34:19.51,Default,,0,0,0,,一定是迈尔斯·戴森{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gotta be. Miles Dyson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:19.55,1:34:21.61,Default,,0,0,0,,她要去杀了他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's gonna blow him away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:21.66,1:34:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,快点! 我们走!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on! Let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:36.14,1:34:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,就战术上来说 这很危险{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is tactically dangerous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:38.24,1:34:39.37,Default,,0,0,0,,开快一点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Drive faster.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:39.41,1:34:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,T-1000拥有与我相同的资料{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The T-1000 has the same files that I do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:42.04,1:34:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道的 他全都知道 它可能会预料到这一招{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It knows what I know. It might anticipate this move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:45.55,1:34:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我不管 我们得阻止她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't care. We gotta stop her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:48.08,1:34:50.05,Default,,0,0,0,,杀了Dyson可能会避免战争发生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Killing Dyson maybe actually prevent the war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:50.09,1:34:51.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我才不在乎呢!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't care!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:52.55,1:34:54.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你还是学不会吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Haven't you learned anything yet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:54.39,1:34:56.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你有没有想过 为什么你不可以杀人?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Haven't you figured out why you can't kill people?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:59.59,1:35:02.19,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 也许你不在乎是死是活...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, maybe you don't care if you live or die...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:02.23,1:35:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,但不是每个人都会这样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but everybody's not like that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:04.46,1:35:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我们拥有感情 会受伤 会恐惧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have feelings. We hurt. We're afraid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:10.57,1:35:14.27,Default,,0,0,0,,这点你要牢记 我说真的 这很重要{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got to learn this stuff. I'm not kidding. It's important.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:51.78,1:35:55.11,Default,,0,0,0,,丹尼 我告诉过你 得跟姐姐一样上床睡觉了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Danny, I told you to go to bed, like your sister.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:55.15,1:35:57.45,Default,,0,0,0,,再等一下 妈!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just a couple of minutes, Mom!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:14.10,1:36:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,丹尼 上床时间到了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Danny, your time is up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:16.54,1:36:19.51,Default,,0,0,0,,快来刷牙 然后去睡觉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come brush your teeth and get to bed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:48.04,1:36:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,丹尼!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Danny!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:01.25,1:37:02.65,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Daddy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:02.68,1:37:05.17,Default,,0,0,0,,丹尼 快走! 快走!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Danny, go! Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:06.72,1:37:07.95,Default,,0,0,0,,迈尔斯?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Miles?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:13.16,1:37:15.63,Default,,0,0,0,,- 托西娅 快走!  - 我的天哪!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Tarissa, run!  - Oh, my God!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:22.67,1:37:24.73,Default,,0,0,0,,快带丹尼离开!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just take Danny and run!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:24.77,1:37:26.07,Default,,0,0,0,,快跑!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Run!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:26.11,1:37:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,老天呀! 迈尔斯!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, Jesus! Miles!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:46.76,1:37:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Daddy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:49.47,1:37:50.99,Default,,0,0,0,,任何人都不准动!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nobody fucking move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:51.77,1:37:53.07,Default,,0,0,0,,别伤害我爸!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't hurt my daddy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:53.10,1:37:54.69,Default,,0,0,0,,趴在地上 婊子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On the floor, bitch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:54.74,1:37:56.93,Default,,0,0,0,,现在就趴在地上!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get down now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:57.77,1:37:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,让开!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get out of the way!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:58.94,1:38:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,别伤害他!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't hurt him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:01.88,1:38:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,现在就趴在地上!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get on the floor now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:06.95,1:38:08.71,Default,,0,0,0,,求你让小孩走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just let the boy go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:08.75,1:38:10.38,Default,,0,0,0,,闭嘴 闭嘴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shut up. Shut up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:10.42,1:38:11.75,Default,,0,0,0,,给我闭嘴!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shut up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:11.79,1:38:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,一切都是你的错 你这畜生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's all your fault, motherfucker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:14.46,1:38:16.75,Default,,0,0,0,,- 都是你的错!  - 什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's all your fault!  - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:16.79,1:38:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会让你这样做的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not gonna let you do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:10.92,1:39:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,该死! 我们慢了一步!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit! We're too late!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:17.52,1:39:18.65,Default,,0,0,0,,检查他们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Check them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:22.33,1:39:24.35,Default,,0,0,0,,看着我 妈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at me, Mom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:24.39,1:39:26.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你没受伤吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you hurt?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:30.23,1:39:32.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我差点就...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I almost...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:43.95,1:39:46.35,Default,,0,0,0,,没事了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It'll be okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:46.38,1:39:48.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会想出办法的 好吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll figure something out. Okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:49.92,1:39:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我保证{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I promise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:54.86,1:39:57.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你是来阻止我的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You came here to stop me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:58.70,1:40:00.67,Default,,0,0,0,,对呀 没错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:03.54,1:40:05.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我爱你 约翰{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love you, John.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:07.21,1:40:08.80,Default,,0,0,0,,永远爱你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I always have.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:10.68,1:40:12.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:19.12,1:40:21.35,Default,,0,0,0,,子弹穿过身体{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Deep penetration.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:22.92,1:40:24.89,Default,,0,0,0,,没有打碎骨头{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No shattered bone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:24.92,1:40:27.89,Default,,0,0,0,,握紧这里 施压可以止血{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold here. The pressure should stop the bleeding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:38.64,1:40:40.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你们是什么人?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who are you people?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:41.01,1:40:42.48,Default,,0,0,0,,给他看看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Show him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:45.11,1:40:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,丹尼 我希望你跟我来 带我去你的房间 好吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Danny, I want you to come with me right now. Show me your room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:29.76,1:41:31.05,Default,,0,0,0,,噢 上帝啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:31.09,1:41:33.75,Default,,0,0,0,,现在给我仔细听好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now listen to me very carefully.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:39.63,1:41:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,戴森仔细聆听 终结者全盘托出{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dyson listened while the Terminator laid it all down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:43.84,1:41:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,天网 审判日{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Skynet. Judgment Day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:47.77,1:41:50.11,Default,,0,0,0,,整件事的由来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The history of things to come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:51.51,1:41:54.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你不是每天都会发现你必须为...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not every day that you find out you're responsible...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:54.35,1:41:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,30亿人的死亡负责{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for three billion deaths.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:57.25,1:41:59.22,Default,,0,0,0,,他差不多理解了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He took it pretty well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:01.19,1:42:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得我快吐了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I feel like I'm gonna throw up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:09.66,1:42:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你以我还未做的事...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're judging me...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:11.87,1:42:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,审判我的过失{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}on things I haven't even done yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:18.54,1:42:20.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我们怎知会变成这样?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How were we supposed to know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:23.11,1:42:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,对啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:25.15,1:42:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,没错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:27.62,1:42:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你们怎么会知道?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How were you supposed to know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:30.82,1:42:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,一群像你一样的人渣...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fucking men like you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:32.72,1:42:34.55,Default,,0,0,0,,建造了氢弹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}built the hydrogen bomb.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:34.59,1:42:37.22,Default,,0,0,0,,像你一样的家伙...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Men like you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:37.26,1:42:38.73,Default,,0,0,0,,投下了它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}thought it up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:42.56,1:42:44.53,Default,,0,0,0,,你们自认为很有创造力吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think you're so creative.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:45.93,1:42:49.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你们根本不知什么是真正的创造...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't know what it's like to really create something...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:49.10,1:42:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,去创造生命...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to create a life...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:51.34,1:42:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,感受它在你体内成长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to feel it growing inside you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:52.94,1:42:55.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你们只知道如何创造死亡及毁灭万物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All you know how to create is death and destruction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:55.95,1:42:57.67,Default,,0,0,0,,妈!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mom!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:57.71,1:43:01.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要做点有建设性的事 好吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need to be a little more constructive here. Okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:01.55,1:43:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我们还得阻止这一切发生 对吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We still have to stop this from happening, don't we?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:03.72,1:43:06.59,Default,,0,0,0,,但是我想...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I thought...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:06.62,1:43:10.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不是正在改变一切? 改变它未来的发展?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aren't we changing things? I mean right now, changing the way it goes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:10.69,1:43:15.56,Default,,0,0,0,,没错 打死我也不想完成 那处理器了 至少现在不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's right. There's no way I'm going to finish the new processor. Not now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:15.60,1:43:19.09,Default,,0,0,0,,算了 我退出 我明天就辞职{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Forget it. I'm out of it. I'll quit Cyberdyne tomorrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:19.14,1:43:21.07,Default,,0,0,0,,这样还不够{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's not good enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:21.10,1:43:23.07,Default,,0,0,0,,得确保没人接替你的工作{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one must follow your work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:23.11,1:43:25.01,Default,,0,0,0,,对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:25.04,1:43:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 那我们得摧毁实验室里的所有东西...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, then we have to destroy all the stuff at the lab...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:29.48,1:43:31.11,Default,,0,0,0,,文件 磁盘...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the files, the disk drives...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:31.15,1:43:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,在里面的所有东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}everything here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:34.38,1:43:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,完完全全的摧毁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:36.52,1:43:38.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我不在乎了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't care.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:39.72,1:43:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,那块芯片{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The chip.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:40.82,1:43:42.95,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你知道那块芯片吗?  - 什么芯片?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Do you know about the chip?  - What chip?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:42.99,1:43:45.46,Default,,0,0,0,,在公司里 来自一个 与你相同的机器人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's at Cyberdyne. It's from the other one like you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:45.50,1:43:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,第一代终结者的中央处理器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The CPU from the first Terminator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:48.30,1:43:50.73,Default,,0,0,0,,他妈的! 我就知道!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Son of a bitch! I knew it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:50.77,1:43:53.53,Default,,0,0,0,,他们说别问这是从哪弄来的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They told us not to ask where they got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:53.57,1:43:55.93,Default,,0,0,0,,那些说谎的畜生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those lying motherfuckers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:55.97,1:43:57.80,Default,,0,0,0,,这是个很惊人的东西 十分先进{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's scary stuff. Radically advanced.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:57.84,1:43:59.03,Default,,0,0,0,,有点破碎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was smashed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:59.08,1:44:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,不能用了 但它给了我们一些启发 带领我们进入新的领域{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It didn't work, but it gave us ideas, took us in new directions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:02.78,1:44:04.80,Default,,0,0,0,,一些我们从来不会...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean things we would've never...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:06.95,1:44:09.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我所有的工作 都是以它为基础的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All my work was based on it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:09.12,1:44:10.95,Default,,0,0,0,,它必须被摧毁掉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It must be destroyed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:13.19,1:44:16.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你能带我们通过警卫 进入实验室吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you get us in, Past security?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:16.29,1:44:18.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我想可以 什么时候?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think so, yeah. When?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:22.77,1:44:23.89,Default,,0,0,0,,现在?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:28.21,1:44:31.30,Default,,0,0,0,,未来如此清晰地展现在我的面前...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The future, always so clear to me...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:31.34,1:44:34.37,Default,,0,0,0,,像是变成一条暗夜里的黑色公路{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}had become like a black highway at night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:34.41,1:44:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我们现正步入未知的领域...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We were in uncharted territory now...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:37.22,1:44:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,,一路走下去 写下历史{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}making up history as we went along.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:18.46,1:45:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,卡尔 没记错吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Carl, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:21.73,1:45:25.19,Default,,0,0,0,,城外来的朋友 我只是想我能否...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Friends from out of town. I just thought I'd...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:25.23,1:45:27.29,Default,,0,0,0,,带他们上楼参观一下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}take 'em upstairs and show 'em around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:27.33,1:45:30.67,Default,,0,0,0,,戴森先生 你明知道 参观实验室的相关规定{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Dyson, you know the rules concerning visitors in the lab.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:30.70,1:45:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,必须要有书面的经授权的文件...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need written authorization...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:33.91,1:45:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我坚持要参观{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I insist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:36.01,1:45:37.81,Default,,0,0,0,,想都别想{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't even think about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:48.72,1:45:50.19,Default,,0,0,0,,这里没人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:51.59,1:45:54.75,Default,,0,0,0,,需要两把钥匙 同时转动 以打开保险库{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It takes two keys, turned simultaneously, to open the vault.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:54.79,1:45:57.76,Default,,0,0,0,,另一把在安全室的柜子里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The other one is in a locker at the security station.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:59.06,1:46:00.53,Default,,0,0,0,,吉布斯?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gibbons?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:03.57,1:46:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,吉布斯! 你在哪里 老兄!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gibbons! Come on, man!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:05.47,1:46:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你不可以擅离职守!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't leave the desk like that!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:13.41,1:46:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,糟糕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:32.47,1:46:34.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我的卡应该可以开启的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My card should access this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:39.14,1:46:41.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- 怎么了?  - 该死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What is it?  - Damn it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:41.64,1:46:43.63,Default,,0,0,0,,静音警报已经启动了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The silent alarm's been tripped.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:49.78,1:46:52.55,Default,,0,0,0,,这使得整栋大楼里的通关密码失效{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's neutralized all the codes in the entire building.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:52.59,1:46:54.55,Default,,0,0,0,,现在任何东西都打不开了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing will open anywhere now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:55.09,1:46:56.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得放弃行动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have to abort.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:57.49,1:46:58.69,Default,,0,0,0,,不行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:00.66,1:47:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,一定要完成 好吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We go all the way. Okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:06.20,1:47:10.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你们先去搞定实验室 这我能打开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You guys get started on the lab. I can open this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:10.10,1:47:12.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我想是购物中心的那个家伙  - 真的是他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I think it's that guy from the mall.  - It is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:12.61,1:47:14.57,Default,,0,0,0,,是他和那个女人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's him and the woman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:16.11,1:47:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,快派遣这地区你能调来的所有警力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just send everything you got in the area right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:21.52,1:47:24.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我有进实验室的个人 密码 也许还能用{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have a personal entry code for the lab. It may still work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:29.46,1:47:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,也不行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's no good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:30.63,1:47:32.15,Default,,0,0,0,,让我试试我的方法{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me try mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:37.13,1:47:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,,约翰 小心要爆炸了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}John, fire in the hole!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:51.25,1:47:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下! 不能直接走进去 火源会引发海龙消防系统{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait! You can't go in there. The fire set off the Halon system.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:03.23,1:48:05.23,Default,,0,0,0,,必须等几分钟 直到气体排空{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have to wait until the gas clears.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:08.19,1:48:09.49,Default,,0,0,0,,戴上这个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put this on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:23.44,1:48:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 开始行动吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, let's get to work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:47.13,1:48:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,附近地区以及能回应的所有单位...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All units in the vicinity and all units able to respond...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:50.50,1:48:55.37,Default,,0,0,0,,211状况 克雷姆街2144号 赛博坦大楼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a 211 in progress, 2144 Kramer Street, the Cyberdyne building.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:55.41,1:48:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,一名嫌犯是白人女性...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Suspect one is white female...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:57.14,1:49:00.63,Default,,0,0,0,,经查证姓名为莎拉康纳{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}identified as last name Connor, first name Sarah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:00.68,1:49:03.65,Default,,0,0,0,,昨晚自皮斯卡德罗州立医院出逃{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Escaped last night from Pescadero State Hospital.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:03.68,1:49:05.65,Default,,0,0,0,,第二名嫌犯: 白人男性...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Suspect two: White male...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:09.29,1:49:11.48,Default,,0,0,0,,所有在我办公室里的磁盘...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All the disks in my office...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:11.52,1:49:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,在那边的一间办公室里...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}all the disks in that office over there...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:13.76,1:49:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我办公桌后面的所有东西...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}everything behind my desk...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:15.83,1:49:18.13,Default,,0,0,0,,以及左边的那些主机{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and all the processors on my left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:18.16,1:49:20.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会用CP4炸药炸掉这些{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll blow those with the CP4.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:34.35,1:49:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我能不能...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can I...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:35.98,1:49:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:39.45,1:49:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,能不能借我用一下?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can I borrow that thing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:51.16,1:49:53.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我在这东西上花了好几年心思{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I worked a lot of years on this thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:57.54,1:49:59.77,Default,,0,0,0,,1-玛丽23号 再说一次地点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One-Mary-23, give me that location again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:59.81,1:50:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,克雷姆街2111号{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}2111 Kramer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:01.64,1:50:04.63,Default,,0,0,0,,嫌犯持有武器而且判定为极度危险{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Suspects are armed and considered extremely dangerous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:56.99,1:50:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:58.76,1:51:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,7-2-5-6\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}7-2-5-6.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:07.54,1:51:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,,容易来的钱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Easy money.{\r}
