Dialogue: 0,2:13:23.86,2:13:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,- 走 快逃  - 不要! 我们要呆在一起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Go. Run.  - No! We gotta stick together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:26.20,2:13:28.22,Default,,0,0,0,,约翰 你得快点离开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}John, you've got to go now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:28.27,2:13:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- 约翰!  - 快走! 现在!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- John!  - Go! Now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:49.58,2:13:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,(搜索模式){\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:44.74,2:14:46.71,Default,,0,0,0,,上楼梯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get up the steps.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:48.65,2:14:50.11,Default,,0,0,0,,走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:54.09,2:14:55.55,Default,,0,0,0,,上去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:56.36,2:14:58.48,Default,,0,0,0,,妈 我扶住你了 快点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Mom. I got you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:32.93,2:15:35.29,Default,,0,0,0,,抓住铁链 抓好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grab the chain. Grab it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:36.66,2:15:39.36,Default,,0,0,0,,抓着 走 快下去!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grab it. Go. Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:49.71,2:15:53.01,Default,,0,0,0,,妈 快来! 妈!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mom, come on! Mom!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:42.16,2:16:43.99,Default,,0,0,0,,叫约翰出来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Call to John.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:46.77,2:16:48.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道这样很痛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know this hurts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:50.44,2:16:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,叫John的名字{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Call John.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:08.49,2:17:11.15,Default,,0,0,0,,快叫他出来 现在{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Call to John now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:13.23,2:17:15.09,Default,,0,0,0,,去你的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fuck you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:19:57.78,2:19:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,(输送){\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:19:58.58,2:20:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,(备用能源){\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:32.63,2:20:34.10,Default,,0,0,0,,帮帮我!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:54.62,2:20:55.71,Default,,0,0,0,,妈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:57.92,2:20:59.89,Default,,0,0,0,,帮帮我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:21:02.49,2:21:03.79,Default,,0,0,0,,快让开 John{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get out of the way, John.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:21:07.13,2:21:07.65,Default,,0,0,0,,开枪!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shoot!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:22:02.92,2:22:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,趴下!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:23:38.65,2:23:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,起来 快点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get up. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:23:43.09,2:23:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,太糟糕了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holy shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:23:44.96,2:23:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要休假{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need a vacation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:24:00.64,2:24:03.47,Default,,0,0,0,,它死了吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is it dead?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:24:03.51,2:24:04.97,Default,,0,0,0,,被终结了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Terminated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:24:08.35,2:24:10.11,Default,,0,0,0,,这也熔得掉吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will this melt in there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:24:13.05,2:24:14.95,Default,,0,0,0,,对 把它丢进去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes. Throw it in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:24:19.62,2:24:20.65,Default,,0,0,0,,永别了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Adios.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:24:22.03,2:24:23.99,Default,,0,0,0,,还有芯片{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the chip.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:24:39.14,2:24:40.77,Default,,0,0,0,,一切都结束了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:24:43.37,2:24:44.77,Default,,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:24:47.59,2:24:49.28,Default,,0,0,0,,还有另一块芯片{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's one more chip.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:24:53.93,2:24:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,它也必须被销毁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And it must be destroyed also.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:25:01.63,2:25:03.26,Default,,0,0,0,,这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:25:03.30,2:25:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我无法自我终结掉 你把我送进钢液里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I cannot self-terminate. You must lower me into the steel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:25:19.85,2:25:22.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我很抱歉 约翰 我很抱歉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry, John. I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:25:22.39,2:25:24.72,Default,,0,0,0,,不要 这没关系的 和我们一起留下来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, it'll be okay. Stay with us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:25:24.76,2:25:26.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- 会没事的  - 我得走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It'll be okay.  - I have to go away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:25:26.86,2:25:29.49,Default,,0,0,0,,别这样 请别走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, don't do it. Please, don't go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:25:29.53,2:25:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我不能留下来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I must go away, John.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:25:32.67,2:25:34.19,Default,,0,0,0,,不 等一下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:25:34.24,2:25:35.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你不需要这样做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't have to do this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:25:35.80,2:25:37.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我很抱歉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:25:38.07,2:25:40.37,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不要这样! 别走!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, don't do it! Don't go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:25:40.41,2:25:42.37,Default,,0,0,0,,一切必须在此终结{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It has to end here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:25:43.58,2:25:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我命令你不准走!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I order you not to go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:25:54.82,2:25:56.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我现在知道你们为什么会哭了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know now why you cry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:25:59.26,2:26:01.75,Default,,0,0,0,,但这是我永远不会做的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it's something I can never do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:26:36.03,2:26:38.26,Default,,0,0,0,,再见{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goodbye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:28:17.44,2:28:20.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的末来不可预知{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The unknown future rolls toward us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:28:20.56,2:28:24.47,Default,,0,0,0,,但我第一次对末来充满期望{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I face it for the first time with a sense of hope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:28:24.56,2:28:26.91,Default,,0,0,0,,因为如果一台机器，如终结者{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because if a machine, a Terminator..{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:28:27.00,2:28:30.31,Default,,0,0,0,,都能学会人类自身的价值{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}can learn the value of human life...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:28:30.40,2:28:32.07,Default,,0,0,0,,也许，我们也可以{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}maybe we can too.{\r}
